GTA Trilogy RPC

A Windows application that displays Discord Rich Presence while playing Grand Theft Auto III, Grand Theft Auto: Vice City, and Grand Theft Auto: San Andreas.
Features

    Automatic detection of supported GTA games.

    Game-specific Discord Rich Presence and artwork.

    Live game-state information, including missions, locations, menus, and cutscenes where supported.

    Windows system tray application.

Requirements

    Windows x64

    Discord desktop application

    A supported GTA game installed

Installation

Download the Windows x64 archive from the Releases page, extract it, and run GtaTrilogyRpc.exe.
Status

Version 0.2.0 — early release.
